    "tree_id": "72fc1b36f93d6e4fe2e73068fc04a1884b9ff9d9",
    "message": "[ipa-delivery:763] build the private test IPA 763: RPCS3 Core 942 (God of War III lot of the IPA 760 logs), on base 762\n\nRPCS3 Core 942 (pin 49e51ae4, run 43950007115, fingerprint 67fbf239) replaces Core 941: REWINDBOX_SCOPED_CPU_BLIT_942\n(a CPU image transfer of the RSX revalidates only the cached textures over the bytes it wrote; 69 of the 84 texture\nepochs of a God of War III frame came from these transfers), REWINDBOX_POST_AA_942 (FXAA at presentation while the\nMLAA bypass leaves the title with no anti-aliasing; setting; Bilinear output mode) and REWINDBOX_HOT_CODE_942 (code\nwords of the busiest regions in the profile captures). Codegen identities unchanged. The MeloNX Core and the S2Arm\nengine are those of the base 762 (run 43948166194). Contract (offline), freeze and trigger paths checked. Flutter\nand native test groups not run (AGENTS.md). Not run on an iPhone; no frame rate, picture or heat claim.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-16T20:55:32Z",
